 // scaled texture under the floor is made at 1x instead (from guest memory, which image readback keeps
 // current) rather than not at all. The 10 s line breaks the memory down by kind.
+// Fix 117d: Battlefield 3 at 2x (1.0.5-work-fix117c, no image readback) showed why both fallbacks were wrong. A
+// scaled resolve writes only the scaled resolve buffer, so a texture made at 1x read old guest memory (a flat grey
